# Build output. `scripts/build.sh` writes platform binaries into dist/ and
# `scripts/release.sh` packages them from there; both are published to the
# GitHub releases page, which is where the README already sends people. They
# were tracked here until 2026-09-04 — 41 artifacts spanning every version from
# 1.0.0 to 1.0.8, and an 11 MB binary at the root — because this file did not
# exist.
/binman
/dist/

